 "description": "Jung2019 - Regulating glioblastoma signaling pathways and anti-invasion therapy - core control model\nBioModels BIOMD0000000828 (curated). SBML file: Jung2019 model.xml.\nSimulation: 0 to 120 time units (SED-ML: Jung2019 simulation.sedml), sampling 0.12.\nRun switches: -ig:mass -INT:1 -obeymaxint\nVerification against libRoadRunner (SBML reference): PASS, max |difference| = 3.23e-06 of species peak (worst: Glucose_G)\nSBML time units are used unchanged as Kintecus seconds.\nConversion notes:\n  [info] 2 event(s) depend only on time (and on variables only they change): unrolled into 20 firing(s) up to t = 120\n  [info] species 'deltaD' is defined by an assignment rule; not a Kintecus state (not output)\n  [info] time event(s) on 'u_1' encoded as time/value pairs in EV_P_U_1.TXT (SET)\n  [info] time event(s) on 'u_2' encoded as time/value pairs in EV_P_U_2.TXT (SET)\nRenamed species (Kintecus name = SBML id): p_u_1 = u_1; p_u_2 = u_2",
